{"id":2845,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>12月22日晚7时，人文社会科学学院和艺术学院、数学学院联合举办的2026元旦暨迎新晚会在学生活动中心拉开帷幕，三院师生齐聚一堂，共迎新年。<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=zLzrlRMmGDMl7Porl7ZMR7aUl-sL8nI7L4AfU4-iUlnfo7U0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyYLkyDnkyPL4v4LR74MmlYnRA7Um6fLR7ZU49ZLNQ7MzTFMNW7MzQ2MmfFM7UiLzNJv2bjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMzCsgtA8pU5cc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11567&e=.png\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C206D1373013652D8DB7A018C882FD59/6BD56F60/4D519\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=zMN7lYLlQfnRQ7MrR-8ozLiMzWRol7IPUmMVMml4o7Q2U4l0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyPoSyZU1h2LlnkL8rkLm-aL8CbMl-YU8C4M8CPMNWkUzfFLz62LzrRn7QFnzCDnzlJv2bjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMzCsgtA8pU5cc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11567&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p><p>晚会由各学院学生代表联袂主持，人文社科学院两名同学参与主持工作。晚会节目形式多样、精彩纷呈，人文社会科学学院学子带来的《舞蹈串烧》凭借活力编排与动感节奏点燃全场，尽显青春朝气与艺术表现力。&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=zLRLl4UmvaL4LYMrmNPUNCsMRl8M4UIDMNnVLznfozMkMll0gihFp2hmCIa0U1y8UYyaoSyZUN7YLNLPUNMRoRAfnRlPnzrkozT2U4Q2UNVFUmTkn7lPLRVFMRAkM4CJv2bjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMzCsgtA8pU5cc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11567&e=.png\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B4C098BA22C1BCC88AD51E5B99FC6FBA/B9BDE101/48B76\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=zUNClDo7VkMR9aLr4Nbo7lPnmvZU49I8UNl4nl-iU49PUNC0gihFp2hmCIa0LYyPnkhVLkh2U8V2U8-ZL4GsUN-YMm-YUmGYMlUPnNCZnmnFUzCiMRNYMNnFUlCDM7lJv2bjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMzCsgtA8pU5cc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11567&e=.png\"></p><p>人文社科学院礼仪队与麟德汉学社合作的走秀节目《织梦同阶·步曳双华》尤为吸睛。节目融合现代礼仪风范与传统汉服文化，同学们步履优雅、仪态端庄，在舞台上勾勒出兼具古典韵味与现代气息的青春画卷，生动诠释人文之美与礼乐之雅，成为晚会一大亮点。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=zo7llPnNnfLRLiorR9aMmCbozTknNnI2UzLZUlW7L8CsnzL0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yYMkysnShfUzVfLR-YL7VkUmlbU8CZM4linRTfLm9ZUmnFnRlaLmvPLlMFM8-boRvJv2bjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMzCsgtA8pU5cc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11567&e=.png\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F247EAA1A0220ABB59CF8755D9A288B4/D502711C/7B987\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=zo7llPnNnfLRLiorR9aMmCbozTknNnI2UzLZUlW7L8CsnzL0gihFp2hmCIa0n1yYMkysnShfUzVfLR-YL7VkUmlbU8CZM4linRTfLm9ZUmnFnRlaLmvPLlMFM8-boRvJv2bjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMzCsgtA8pU5cc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11567&e=.png\"></p><p>此外，艺术学院、数学学院分别献上《盛世国乐》《勇者》等精彩节目。整场晚会涵盖歌曲、舞蹈、器乐、配音等多种表演形式，展现出兄弟学院学子昂扬向上的精神风貌与团结协作的深厚情谊，晚会在全体合唱《相亲相爱》的温馨旋律中圆满落幕。</p><p>此次跨学院文艺交流活动，既是一场青春与文化的盛宴，也为校园文化建设增添了人文活力。未来，人文社会科学学院将持续推动美育与实践深度融合，鼓励学生在多元舞台展示自我、传承文化。</p><p>新年将至，愿中北学子怀揣热爱，奔赴新程。<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=zMzNlYU4rfnNQRMrzC4LzCbM8rVUm-IsnRUYLRNZL8lDo7U0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyPnkhfMYhVnRCinmNYUznVoRGYLlV7nRGio7linm-anmQFLRTVUmV2MlVFM7V2Mm7Jv2bjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMzCsgtA8pU5cc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11567&e=.png\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/11DA7ED65F92A4E8021ADD058E5F20F6/09EB1F5A/4AF61\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=zLNVlkLzrfMm7aLr8Q2nzCDozUZL4nI2LlL4ollPM49sMmv0gihFp2hmCIa0n1y4LYhVMYyPMm-4MRl4UzlDoRTkMRNaL77YL4VkL7MknRnFMNlaLNU8n7QFU8U8LmUJv2bjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMzCsgtA8pU5cc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11567&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://shss.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=zLzrlRMmGDMl7Porl7ZMR7aUl-sL8nI7L4AfU4-iUlnfo7U0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyYLkyDnkyPL4v4LR74MmlYnRA7Um6fLR7ZU49ZLNQ7MzTFMNW7MzQ2MmfFM7UiLzNJv2bjo4OeosWs_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PMzCsgtA8pU5cc&oid=1219086494&tid=1011&nid=11567&e=.png"}